1
00:00:00,242 --> 00:00:01,672
(Penny:)Yeah, you did.

2
00:00:01,677 --> 00:00:04,577
(Penny:)I felt so self-conscious,
I had to return them.

3
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:07,580
(Bernadette:)Where? To Babies R Us?

4
00:00:07,583 --> 00:00:10,253
You're doing it again!

5
00:00:10,252 --> 00:00:11,752
(Bernadette:)Okay, sorry.
Can we just go?

6
00:00:11,754 --> 00:00:13,254
(Bernadette:)I feel like
everybody hates me.

7
00:00:13,255 --> 00:00:15,255
(Penny:)Oh, come on,
they don't hate you, all right?

8
00:00:15,257 --> 00:00:16,187
(Penny:)They're just
a little intimidated.

9
00:00:16,192 --> 00:00:17,862
(Penny:)All you need to do
is show everyone

10
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:19,230
(Penny:)how sweet you really are.

11
00:00:19,228 --> 00:00:21,098
(Bernadette:)I think I'd
rather go.
No, come on.

12
00:00:21,097 --> 00:00:22,667
(Penny:)You are not going anywhere,
all right?

13
00:00:22,665 --> 00:00:25,065
(Penny:)I am here for you, and we are
gonna fix this together.

14
00:00:25,067 --> 00:00:26,267
(LeVar Burton:)Thank you.

15
00:00:26,268 --> 00:00:28,298
(Penny:)Even though your dress is ugly.

16
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:33,540
(Sheldon:)Well, my little Flag-keteers,

17
00:00:33,542 --> 00:00:37,442
(Sheldon:)it looks like the last episode
of Fun with Flags is at an end.

18
00:00:37,446 --> 00:00:39,446
(Sheldon:)If I could,

19
00:00:39,448 --> 00:00:43,448
(Sheldon:)I would run each and every one
of you viewers up a flagpole

20
00:00:43,452 --> 00:00:46,452
(Sheldon:)and salute you.

21
00:00:46,455 --> 00:00:48,825
(Sheldon:)And if you touched the ground,
burn you.

22
00:00:50,459 --> 00:00:52,089
(Sheldon:)I'd like to take a moment

23
00:00:52,094 --> 00:00:54,224
(Sheldon:)to personally thank
Dr. Amy Farrah Fowler,

24
00:00:54,230 --> 00:00:56,260
(Sheldon:)who you may
or may not know

25
00:00:56,265 --> 00:01:00,435
(Sheldon:)is the first woman to co-host
a flag or banner-related

